<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Know Your Punishment | Green Lab Studio</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #050505;
            --text-main: #eeeeee;
            --text-muted: #aaaaaa;
            --accent-gold: #d4af37;
            --accent-red: #ff3333;
            --border-dark: #333333;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px 60px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1a0505 0%, #050505 100%);
        }

        .app-title {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(255, 51, 51, 0.4);
        }

        .app-title span {
            color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Content Sections */
        .section {
            padding: 50px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
        }

        .section h2 {
            color: var(--accent-red);
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .section p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Features Grid */
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background-color: #111;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent-red);
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
        }

        .contact-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: transparent;
            color: var(--text-main);
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-red);
            padding: 12px 30px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .contact-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-red);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 51, 51, 0.5);
        }

        .footer-text {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="app-title">Know Your <span>Punishment</span></h1>
            <p class="tagline">The Cosmic Scales of Justice Await.</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="section">
            <h2>The Sinners' Registry</h2>
            <p>Know Your Punishment is an advanced, offline Android application designed to calculate the cosmic consequences of mortal deeds. Powered by a custom-built Karma AI Engine, the app analyzes actions and maps them strictly to the 42 Narakas (hell realms) described in ancient scriptures.</p>
            <p>Input the sinner, describe their deeds, and let the localized engine reveal their exact karmic price without ever sending your data to a server.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Core Features</h2>
            <div class="features">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Absolute Privacy</h3>
                    <p>100% offline processing. Your entries, judgments, and descriptions never leave your device. The cosmic link is secured locally.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Karma AI Engine</h3>
                    <p>A zero-latency, local script-detection engine that instantly parses complex contextual scenarios to deliver accurate scriptural judgments.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>42 Narakas</h3>
                    <p>Features deeply researched, scripturally accurate databases for realms like Kumbhipaka and Andhakupa, accounting for diverse transgressions.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Immersive Atmosphere</h3>
                    <p>A dark, beautifully crafted user interface accompanied by haunting ambient audio to match the weight of the cosmic scales.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Face the Judgment</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 30px;">For support, inquiries, or feedback regarding the application.</p>
            
            <a href="mailto:gourabmotolenovo@gmail.com" class="contact-btn">Contact Developer</a>
            
            <div class="footer-links" style="margin-top: 40px;">
                <a href="https://gourabs289-maker.github.io/KYP_privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>
            </div>

            <p class="footer-text">&copy; 2026 Green Lab Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
